# Upstream Swagger UI files embedded by middleware/swagger (celeris#425). They
# must stay byte for byte as published (the bundles' sha384 is pinned), so git
# never converts their line endings, and they are kept out of GitHub's language
# statistics. The minified css and js are also never text-diffed or merged;
# the licence notices still show in diffs, so a version bump's licence
# changes can be reviewed.
middleware/swagger/assets/swagger-ui-dist/** -text linguist-vendored
middleware/swagger/assets/swagger-ui-dist/*.js -diff -merge
middleware/swagger/assets/swagger-ui-dist/*.css -diff -merge

# The API golden files (api/README.md) are compared byte for byte, so a
# checkout with core.autocrlf=true must not give them CRLF line endings.
api/**/*.txt text eol=lf
